  "definitions": {
    "observer": "Read-only callback after each canonical production tick; no extra simulation, mutations or RNG.",
    "shotGroups": "Categories partition attempts. Context/range/quality/pressure rows overlap. Near-six-metre means release within1.5m of the existing curved goal-area boundary; diagnostic region, not an empirical target.",
    "saves": "Non-goal shots with SAVE_CAUGHT/PARRY count saved; goal-after-keeper-touch is retained as a goal and separate keeperTouched fact.",
    "pressureQuality": "0.2 pressure and0.65 quality cuts are descriptive bins aligned with the prior offline reading, not goal-rate targets.",
